  "title": "Keto Beef Egg Roll Slaw",
  "description": "Serve up this keto beef slaw in 30 minutes or less for a quick and tasty stir-fry dinner of crunchy coleslaw and juicy ground beef seasoned with Asian-inspired flavors.",
